source_plane run5_recursive_external
item_kind proof_witness
source_ref campaign:doom-guest
note The one attempt in this campaign that is not a cheat: a controller that reads the rendered frame and nothing else. The controller is the FlyWire fruit-fly connectome, observed through the foreign-twin path and run as SQL in the query organ. The result is negative. It plays from pixels, it is fast, its left-right bias is cancelled, and it explores less of the level than random keys do. That is recorded here as the finding, not as a step toward one.

