  subject guest:doom-shareware-1.9
  profile flywire-783 wave model, six synapses, connections of five or more
  fixture packs/doom-guest/fixtures/e1m1-fly.cmds
  fixture_sha256 82ba7fccb8f0ccfbae966af1bb8ba6f6f568e3a3838b8d588e9a277c04cc7e0a
